s as the part that feels unintuitive. Use it as a supporting idea, not a teaching target.\"},{\"strand\":\"Why the derivatives multiply (the target)\",\"assessment\":\"Floor: he recognizes the sequential-scaling explanation (chosen before the shuffle, so weak evidence). With position shuffled, he correctly est"}],"api":"claude-code-cli","provider":"claude-code","model":"claude-opus-5-5","usage":{"input":2,"output":8,"cacheRead":9460,"cacheWrite":12131,"totalTokens":21601,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0},"cacheWrite1h":12131},"stopReason":"pending","timestamp":1792860897304,"responseId":"msg_011CgMQtJqpYAb2G7W2tPQwx"}}

